    {
      "id": "s04",
      "type": "rubric",
      "text": "Quo finito, repetitur Ad te levávi usque ad psalmum.",
      "narrative": {
        "pl": "Po doksologii powtarza się antyfonę na wejście od Ad te levávi do wersetu psalmu — we Mszy śpiewanej czyni to schola, we Mszy cichej sam kapłan.",
        "en": "After the doxology the Introit antiphon is repeated from Ad te levávi to the psalm verse — by the choir at a sung Mass, by the priest himself at a low Mass."
      }
    },
